WEBVTT

00:00:32.690 --> 00:00:34.900
Your Majesty.

00:00:34.900 --> 00:00:36.900
Your Majesty?

00:00:36.900 --> 00:00:38.280
Your Majesty!

00:00:39.690 --> 00:00:41.570
Sheama.

00:00:41.570 --> 00:00:46.480
I'm sorry; I was lost in thought.

00:00:46.480 --> 00:00:50.110
You were... lost in thought?

00:00:50.110 --> 00:00:51.320
Yes.

00:00:53.320 --> 00:00:54.530
I see.

00:00:54.530 --> 00:00:57.780
I wonder, did the former
queen always look peaceful,

00:00:57.780 --> 00:01:00.360
or did she look like that sometimes, too?

00:01:04.570 --> 00:01:08.190
I am leaving to direct
the reconstruction of Metis.

00:01:08.190 --> 00:01:10.230
Please. I'm counting on you.

00:01:10.230 --> 00:01:11.610
Goodbye, then.

00:01:24.030 --> 00:01:27.530
The former queen...

00:01:47.540 --> 00:01:50.440
"Shironeko Project ZERO CHRONICLE"

00:02:59.150 --> 00:03:04.030
"Shironeko Project ZERO CHRONICLE"

00:03:04.110 --> 00:03:07.040
"Chapter 3:
The Grief-stricken Queen of Light"

00:03:08.900 --> 00:03:13.780
Grant peace to all the people of White.

00:03:14.820 --> 00:03:18.400
Oh, were you praying?

00:03:18.400 --> 00:03:22.150
Yes, Sheama, I just finished.

00:03:23.230 --> 00:03:26.190
I see you're still an early bird.

00:03:26.190 --> 00:03:28.480
It's the one thing I'm good at.

00:03:28.480 --> 00:03:29.940
I wish I could do that.

00:03:29.940 --> 00:03:35.820
It doesn't matter. You have
Phious and Theo to look after.

00:03:35.820 --> 00:03:39.820
They certainly are a handful. Want them?

00:03:39.820 --> 00:03:42.150
You make them sound like things.

00:03:42.150 --> 00:03:43.440
Just kidding.

00:03:43.440 --> 00:03:47.730
Besides, you don't have time to
worry about things like that.

00:03:47.730 --> 00:03:49.190
True.

00:03:49.190 --> 00:03:54.440
Sheama, what is it that a Queen of Light needs?

00:03:54.440 --> 00:03:58.190
I'd like to know that myself.

00:03:58.190 --> 00:03:59.610
I have no idea.

00:03:59.610 --> 00:04:04.440
Still, one of us will succeed to the throne.

00:04:04.440 --> 00:04:08.610
Let's have no hard feelings,
whichever of us is chosen.

00:04:08.610 --> 00:04:09.820
Let's!

00:04:15.780 --> 00:04:18.690
I will show you the utmost devotion.

00:04:18.690 --> 00:04:20.650
Thank you very much.

00:04:20.650 --> 00:04:23.360
Now, please excuse us.

00:04:25.440 --> 00:04:26.860
How lovely.

00:04:26.860 --> 00:04:30.860
She deserves to be called the White Priestess.

00:04:30.860 --> 00:04:33.190
She really does.

00:04:33.190 --> 00:04:36.070
I think that succeeding her as queen

00:04:36.070 --> 00:04:38.980
will be a great responsibility.

00:04:38.980 --> 00:04:40.570
Were you scared?

00:04:42.440 --> 00:04:45.320
What do you think, Sheama?

00:04:46.650 --> 00:04:49.070
I was.

00:04:50.230 --> 00:04:56.400
"The White Priestess dwells in the heavens with
light, ever bearing one end of the balance."

00:04:56.400 --> 00:04:59.230
That means a life cooped up in the palace.

00:04:59.230 --> 00:05:01.900
I'd die of boredom.

00:05:01.900 --> 00:05:04.780
Oh, honestly, Sheama.

00:05:04.780 --> 00:05:09.530
Still, I'm sure that sitting properly
on the throne all the time isn't easy.

00:05:09.530 --> 00:05:12.110
It might not be as bad as you think.

00:05:12.110 --> 00:05:13.230
Huh?

00:05:13.230 --> 00:05:14.610
What do you mean?

00:05:14.610 --> 00:05:18.940
Maybe Her Majesty sneaks out of
the castle at night to have fun.

00:05:18.940 --> 00:05:21.730
No way could I believe that.

00:05:21.730 --> 00:05:25.110
But wouldn't it be funny if it were true?

00:05:26.030 --> 00:05:28.980
You've sure got some bold ideas.

00:05:33.360 --> 00:05:36.860
Speaking of which, you're coming over
for dinner tonight, right?

00:05:36.860 --> 00:05:39.280
Yes, I'm looking forward to it.

00:05:39.280 --> 00:05:42.190
Phious has been looking forward to it, too.

00:05:42.190 --> 00:05:43.820
I'm sure he has!

00:05:43.820 --> 00:05:46.980
It's been so long since we were all together.

00:05:46.980 --> 00:05:50.190
That's not quite what I meant.

00:05:50.190 --> 00:05:51.530
Hmm?

00:05:51.530 --> 00:05:52.980
Oh, forget it.

00:05:54.230 --> 00:05:57.530
I'll go pick some wild greens, then.

00:05:57.530 --> 00:05:59.610
Sure. Thanks.

00:06:02.190 --> 00:06:04.690
Oh, fuki buds.

00:06:07.070 --> 00:06:09.530
And angelica buds, too.

00:06:12.480 --> 00:06:14.940
They all look delicious.

00:06:14.940 --> 00:06:17.230
Oh! There are more over there.

00:06:23.440 --> 00:06:25.230
Thank you for the meal.

00:06:25.230 --> 00:06:27.110
It was delicious.

00:06:27.110 --> 00:06:29.860
Oh, it was nothing special.

00:06:29.860 --> 00:06:31.650
Come back anytime!

00:06:31.650 --> 00:06:35.280
Cooking for four isn't any more work
than cooking for three!

00:06:33.940 --> 00:06:35.280
True, true.

00:06:35.280 --> 00:06:37.030
Thanks, I'd love to.

00:06:37.030 --> 00:06:40.980
Theo, you only get to say things like that
when you're the one who cooked!

00:06:41.980 --> 00:06:44.190
I was speaking on your behalf.

00:06:44.190 --> 00:06:46.530
Hey, don't get too full of yourself.

00:06:48.940 --> 00:06:50.820
Come again whenever you like.

00:06:50.820 --> 00:06:52.150
Thank you.

00:06:53.360 --> 00:06:55.940
Well then, I'll see Iris home.

00:06:55.940 --> 00:06:56.940
Get souvenirs.

00:06:56.940 --> 00:06:58.110
I will not!

00:07:02.480 --> 00:07:08.570
Good grief. Theo always gets more
annoying when we have company.

00:07:08.570 --> 00:07:12.110
It was an entertainingly lively meal.

00:07:12.110 --> 00:07:14.150
If you say so.

00:07:14.150 --> 00:07:17.730
I'm sorry I'm always imposing on you.

00:07:17.730 --> 00:07:19.230
Don't mention it.

00:07:19.230 --> 00:07:21.980
Not to parrot Theo, but it's no extra work.

00:07:21.980 --> 00:07:24.400
Besides, you always bring us wild greens.

00:07:24.400 --> 00:07:26.570
They grow all over in the mountains.

00:07:26.570 --> 00:07:31.820
No, the ones you pick for us... taste better.

00:07:31.820 --> 00:07:33.230
Do they?

00:07:33.230 --> 00:07:34.820
I think they taste the same no matter who--

00:07:34.820 --> 00:07:35.730
No!

00:07:35.730 --> 00:07:36.570
Huh?

00:07:36.570 --> 00:07:38.610
Oh, umm...

00:07:38.610 --> 00:07:41.900
Sorry. I shouldn't have shouted.

00:07:41.900 --> 00:07:45.110
But they really do taste better. I mean it.

00:07:45.110 --> 00:07:47.780
Do they really?

00:07:47.780 --> 00:07:49.440
I'm glad.

00:07:49.440 --> 00:07:50.610
Yes.

00:07:50.610 --> 00:07:53.690
I love... wild greens.

00:07:57.980 --> 00:08:01.070
Yes, I love them.

00:08:01.070 --> 00:08:03.400
So much that it can be a little bitter.

00:08:05.940 --> 00:08:08.650
Thank you for walking me home.

00:08:08.650 --> 00:08:10.150
I'll be fine from here.

00:08:10.150 --> 00:08:13.110
All right. Come back anytime.

00:08:17.320 --> 00:08:18.780
Phious!

00:08:20.980 --> 00:08:25.530
What does a Queen of Light need?

00:08:25.530 --> 00:08:26.860
Hmm...

00:08:26.860 --> 00:08:30.070
Th-That was a weird question. Forget it.

00:08:30.070 --> 00:08:31.110
No.

00:08:31.110 --> 00:08:33.360
I don't know the answer,

00:08:33.360 --> 00:08:37.940
but I think just thinking about
the queen's role is meaningful.

00:08:39.030 --> 00:08:43.980
I only think about what I should be doing
as a blade to protect the queen.

00:08:46.110 --> 00:08:48.150
Thank you very much.

00:08:48.150 --> 00:08:52.360
I'll think properly on my own

00:08:52.360 --> 00:08:56.320
about what matters most for a Queen of Light.

00:08:59.530 --> 00:09:01.150
What a nice breeze.

00:09:02.320 --> 00:09:08.820
But I'm sure that if I succeed
the Queen of Light, it will all change.

00:09:08.820 --> 00:09:11.070
Even the meaning of this view.

00:09:15.980 --> 00:09:17.940
I have to warn the knights!

00:09:23.730 --> 00:09:26.440
In that case, I'll just have to do it...

00:09:26.440 --> 00:09:27.570
...myself!

00:09:28.440 --> 00:09:31.190
Rune, lend me your power!

00:09:33.690 --> 00:09:38.030
Wicked darkness, vanish from these skies!

00:09:54.070 --> 00:09:56.030
I... did it?

00:09:59.360 --> 00:10:02.360
I dispelled the darkness!

00:10:02.360 --> 00:10:03.530
Huh?

00:10:04.360 --> 00:10:08.190
The White Priestess is the last bastion.

00:10:08.190 --> 00:10:09.690
This voice...

00:10:09.690 --> 00:10:11.230
Are you...?

00:10:14.320 --> 00:10:18.900
She must confront loneliness
and fight through it.

00:10:19.900 --> 00:10:23.070
Confront loneliness...

00:10:23.070 --> 00:10:25.150
...and fight through it.

00:10:25.150 --> 00:10:29.150
I will protect it, no matter
how lonely that duty is.

00:10:29.150 --> 00:10:32.030
I'll do it to maintain
the balance of black and white.

00:10:32.030 --> 00:10:35.110
That is my role.

00:10:35.110 --> 00:10:38.570
Even if I'm the only one who wishes for that,

00:10:38.570 --> 00:10:41.190
I will stand firm!

00:10:44.030 --> 00:10:49.030
"No. 03 Iris is an early riser"
"She gets up before it is fully light
and performs her duties,
such as picking wild greens or training.
Getting to work before anyone else
is a sought-after quality in a queen."

00:10:53.650 --> 00:10:54.650
Yes.

00:10:54.650 --> 00:10:57.900
It appears that you are fully prepared.

00:11:00.190 --> 00:11:02.440
Aren't you coming, Vallus?

00:11:02.440 --> 00:11:04.440
I must attend the king.

00:11:06.860 --> 00:11:13.150
You will participate in the ceremony
on the Skeers family's recommendation.

00:11:13.150 --> 00:11:15.190
Please have faith in yourself.

00:11:15.190 --> 00:11:16.400
Besides...

00:11:17.690 --> 00:11:21.570
...I can vouch for your ability.

00:11:23.570 --> 00:11:24.900
I'm going.

00:11:27.400 --> 00:11:29.230
Take care.

00:11:31.320 --> 00:11:36.900
We have gathered here today to determine
the ranks of the king's successors.

00:11:36.900 --> 00:11:39.690
Thank you for your participation!

00:11:39.690 --> 00:11:42.940
I will award the prime successor
who triumphs in this competition

00:11:42.940 --> 00:11:44.320
with this:

00:11:45.570 --> 00:11:48.280
the Greatsword of Black!

00:11:50.280 --> 00:11:54.150
So, whoever gets that
greatsword is the next king.

00:11:56.730 --> 00:11:57.820
And?

00:11:57.820 --> 00:12:00.780
How are you going to rank us?

00:12:00.780 --> 00:12:01.730
First,

00:12:01.730 --> 00:12:03.610
you will battle monsters.

00:12:03.610 --> 00:12:08.440
The remaining two contenders
will then settle the matter in a duel.

00:12:09.570 --> 00:12:10.980
I see.

00:12:10.980 --> 00:12:12.780
I won't hold back.

00:12:12.780 --> 00:12:16.940
I hope you don't mind if someone
gets worse than just hurt.

00:12:16.940 --> 00:12:18.860
Please do not worry.

00:12:18.860 --> 00:12:21.860
We are prepared to provide aid.

00:12:21.860 --> 00:12:26.570
Please feel free to withdraw
if you feel that you are in danger.

00:12:36.230 --> 00:12:39.570
Now, are you all prepared?

00:12:39.570 --> 00:12:41.440
Yes!

00:12:41.440 --> 00:12:45.440
In that case, the competition will now begin!

00:13:02.440 --> 00:13:04.530
Is this all?

00:13:15.320 --> 00:13:17.230
What, over already?

00:13:21.820 --> 00:13:23.070
Huh?

00:13:35.280 --> 00:13:36.940
Well now.

00:13:49.150 --> 00:13:51.900
I knew they'd all be strong.

00:13:54.280 --> 00:13:55.570
What?!

00:14:00.150 --> 00:14:01.730
She's done for.

00:14:04.980 --> 00:14:05.860
Move!

00:14:05.860 --> 00:14:07.320
What?!

00:14:14.730 --> 00:14:16.780
Prince?!

00:14:16.780 --> 00:14:18.230
I don't need your mercy!

00:14:18.230 --> 00:14:20.190
Hey, you!

00:14:20.190 --> 00:14:21.900
What's the big idea?

00:14:21.900 --> 00:14:25.150
I helped someone. That's all.

00:14:25.150 --> 00:14:26.530
Hang on,

00:14:26.530 --> 00:14:28.650
are you kidding?

00:14:29.530 --> 00:14:32.110
Why did you save her?! Tell me!

00:14:40.780 --> 00:14:43.150
I wonder how many will survive this one.

00:14:44.070 --> 00:14:45.400
Too slow!

00:14:59.730 --> 00:15:01.360
At this distance...!

00:15:08.030 --> 00:15:11.480
Looks like I can't afford to
take this one lightly!

00:15:22.150 --> 00:15:23.480
Damn!

00:15:24.900 --> 00:15:26.900
You can burn together!

00:15:43.070 --> 00:15:45.400
Damn it... all...!

00:15:46.940 --> 00:15:49.940
What a bunch of clowns.

00:15:49.940 --> 00:15:51.650
Treat the wounded!

00:15:51.650 --> 00:15:52.860
Yes, ma'am!

00:15:55.730 --> 00:15:58.780
I'd expect no less from
the Skeers family's choice.

00:15:58.780 --> 00:16:01.230
We're the only ones left.

00:16:04.150 --> 00:16:05.530
Watch out!

00:16:12.190 --> 00:16:13.980
Want some more?

00:16:15.320 --> 00:16:16.570
N-No!

00:16:16.570 --> 00:16:18.940
I-I give up!

00:16:18.940 --> 00:16:20.280
Why?

00:16:21.980 --> 00:16:25.150
Because there's no point
going at it with small fry like him.

00:16:29.570 --> 00:16:31.030
That's enough!

00:16:31.030 --> 00:16:35.360
Once preparations are complete,
you two will duel!

00:16:38.980 --> 00:16:40.820
I want to ask you something.

00:16:42.650 --> 00:16:45.440
Why did you help a stranger?

00:16:45.440 --> 00:16:47.690
Didn't you do the same thing?

00:16:47.690 --> 00:16:50.820
I told you, there's no point fighting small fry!

00:16:50.820 --> 00:16:55.360
In that case, I helped someone
because they were about to be killed.

00:16:56.480 --> 00:16:58.900
Isn't that reason enough?

00:16:58.900 --> 00:17:00.230
No, it's not!

00:17:00.230 --> 00:17:04.690
If you want to be the King of Darkness,
you don't need to help people!

00:17:04.690 --> 00:17:06.030
What?!

00:17:12.400 --> 00:17:14.860
Other people won't help you.

00:17:14.860 --> 00:17:17.900
That's why you need power.

00:17:19.610 --> 00:17:22.230
If it will help you become king,

00:17:22.230 --> 00:17:25.110
you should just let other people die.

00:17:25.110 --> 00:17:29.610
If abandoning and killing people
is the only way to become king,

00:17:29.610 --> 00:17:33.230
then I'll find another way.

00:17:33.230 --> 00:17:37.610
You're going to end up regretting those words.

00:17:59.360 --> 00:18:01.820
Are you both ready?

00:18:01.820 --> 00:18:03.030
We are.

00:18:04.150 --> 00:18:06.320
Then begin!

00:18:29.280 --> 00:18:32.230
They seem evenly matched in skill.

00:18:32.230 --> 00:18:33.780
But...

00:18:33.780 --> 00:18:35.150
What's wrong?!

00:18:35.150 --> 00:18:37.070
Is that all you've got?!

00:18:53.070 --> 00:18:54.360
Why?

00:18:54.360 --> 00:18:56.940
Why won't you kill me?!

00:18:56.940 --> 00:18:59.570
I glimpsed an ideal,

00:18:59.570 --> 00:19:03.860
so I have a duty to devote my life to it!

00:19:03.860 --> 00:19:05.650
What?!

00:19:05.650 --> 00:19:08.530
I will change this world

00:19:08.530 --> 00:19:11.650
so that people can be happy!

00:19:16.570 --> 00:19:19.570
Spare me the platitudes!

00:19:32.980 --> 00:19:36.360
I... lose.

00:19:36.360 --> 00:19:39.860
You'll be the next king.

00:19:43.530 --> 00:19:46.360
The prime successor to the throne,

00:19:46.360 --> 00:19:49.650
the Prince of Darkness, has been born!

00:19:53.900 --> 00:19:56.360
Now, as proof,

00:19:56.360 --> 00:19:58.480
take the Greatsword of Black!

00:20:09.150 --> 00:20:11.320
Prove to me

00:20:11.320 --> 00:20:14.320
that you're not all talk.

00:20:14.320 --> 00:20:15.530
I will!

00:20:19.030 --> 00:20:22.730
So, anyway, what's your name?

00:20:22.730 --> 00:20:26.730
Huh? Talk about unfriendly.

00:20:26.730 --> 00:20:27.820
Oh well.

00:20:27.820 --> 00:20:29.440
I'm Adel.

00:20:29.440 --> 00:20:33.110
Pleased to meet you, Your Highness.

00:20:38.690 --> 00:20:40.070
Vallus.

00:20:42.110 --> 00:20:45.650
I see I need not ask how it went.

00:20:46.980 --> 00:20:51.320
So, what does the great
dark knight want with us?

00:20:51.320 --> 00:20:54.400
Deliver this... to the Kingdom of White.

00:20:55.280 --> 00:21:03.480
The first and second in line to the throne
are to deliver a message as special envoys.

00:21:03.480 --> 00:21:07.610
The Kingdom... of White.

00:21:34.610 --> 00:21:36.480
Something wrong?

00:21:36.480 --> 00:21:37.980
I was just thinking.

00:21:37.980 --> 00:21:39.230
What about?

00:21:40.650 --> 00:21:42.820
About what a king needs...

00:21:43.980 --> 00:21:45.820
...and how they should be.

00:23:22.280 --> 00:23:23.690
Your Majesty!

00:23:25.110 --> 00:23:26.190
Phious.

00:23:26.190 --> 00:23:28.780
A messenger has come from the Kingdom of Black!

00:23:44.070 --> 00:23:47.030
"Next Time"
"Chapter 4: The Messenger From Black"
